n (UPSC)</b></span></h2>\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>UPSC Engineering Service Examination 2026</b></span></h2>\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>UPSC Engineering Services Advt No. 02/2026 : Short Details of Notification</b></span></h2>\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><b></b></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\" width=\"324\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Application Begin : <strong>26/09/2025</strong></li>\n<li>Last Date for Apply Online : <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><b>16/10/2025 upto 06 PM<br>\n</b></span></li>\n<li>Pay Exam Fee Last Date :<b> 16/10/2025<br>\n</b></li>\n<li>OTR Modification : <strong>As per Schedule<br>\n</strong></li>\n<li>Exam Date Pre : <b>08/02/2026</b></li>\n<li>Admit Card Available Pre : <strong>30/01/2026</strong></li>\n<li>Result Available Pre : <strong>26/02/2026</strong></li>\n<li>Mains Exam Date : <b><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">21 June 2026</span><br>\n</b></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"314\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>General / OBC : <b>200/-</b></li>\n<li>SC / ST : <b>0/-</b></li>\n<li>PH <b>: 0/-</b></li>\n<li>All Category Female :<b> 0/-</b></li>\n<li>Pay the Examination Fee Through Online Fee Payment Mode SBI E Pay Debit Card, Credit Card, Net Banking or Pay the UPSC Engineering Service Exam Fee Through Offline E Challan Mode Submit Fee to Any Branches of State Bank of India.<b> </b></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"9\" valign=\"top\" width=\"638\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>UPSC Engineering Services 2026 : Vacancy Details <span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\">Total : 474 Post </span><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><br>\n</span></b></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"135\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>Post Name</b></p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"86\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>Total Post</b></p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"170\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>UPSC Engg Age Limit</b></p>\n</td>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"247\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>UPSC Engineering Services Eligibility</b></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"135\">\n<p align=\"center\">Civil Engineering</p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"86\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><strong>474</strong></h2>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"5\" rowspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"170\">\n<ul>\n<li><strong>21-30</strong> Year As on 01/01/2026</li>\n<li>Age Relaxation Extra as per Rules.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"247\">\n<ul>\n<li>Passed / Appearing Engineering Degree in Related Trade / Stream</li>\n<li>For More Details Must Read the Full Notification.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"135\">\n<p align=\"center\">Mechanical Engineering</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"135\">\n<p align=\"center\">Electrical Engineering</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"135\">\n<p align=\"center\">Electronics &amp; Telecommunication Engineering</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"9\" valign=\"top\" width=\"638\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><b><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\">UPSC Engineering Services 2026 Exam Center</span> </b></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"317\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>UPSC Engg. Services Prelim Exam 2026</b></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Agartala, Ahmedabad, Aizawl, Aligarh, Prayagraj, Bagalore, Bareilly, Bhopal, Chandigarh, Chennai, Cuttack, Dehradun, Delhi, Dharwad, Guwahati, Gangtok, Hyderabad, Imphal, Itanagar, Jaipur, Jammu, Jorhat, Kochi, Kohima, Kolkata, Lucknow, Madurai, Mumbai, Nagpur, Panaji, Patna, Port Blair, Raipur, Ranchi, Sambhalpur, Shillong, Shimla, Srinagar, Trivandrum, Tirupati, Udaipur &amp; Vishakhapatnam Only.</li>\n<li><b>Note : Prelim Exam Center Are Limited Slot.</b></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"321\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>UPSC Engg. Services Mains Exam 2026</b></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Ahmedabad, Aizawl, Allahabad, Bagalore, Bhopal, Chandigarh, Chennai, Cuttack, Dehradun, Delhi, Dispur, Hyderabad, Jaipur, Jammu, Kolkata, Lucknow, Mumbai, Patna, Raipur, Ranchi, Shillong, Shimla, Trivandrum &amp; Vishwakhapatnam.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"9\" valign=\"top\" width=\"638\"><center><br>\n<!-- 300 x 250 mar 23 --><br>\n<br>\n</center><p></p>\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b><span style=\"color: #008000;\">How to Fill UPSC Engineering Services Online Form 2026</span></b></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Union Public Service Commission UPSC Engineering Services 2025 Examination. Candidate Can Apply Between <b>26/09/2025 to 16/10/2025</b></li>\n<li>Candidate Read the Notification Before Apply the Recruitment Jobs Application Form in UPSC Engineering Services Latest UPSC Job Recruitment 2025.</li>\n<li>Kindly Check and Collect the All Document – Eligibility, ID Proof, Address Details, Basic Details.</li>\n<li>Kindly Ready Scan Document Related to Recruitment Form – Photo, Sign, ID Proof, Etc.</li>\n<li>Before Submit the Application Form Must Check the Preview and All Column Carefully.</li>\n<li>If Candidate Are Required to Paying the Application Fee Must Pay and Complete Your Form</li>\n<li>Take A Print Out of Final Submitted Form.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"9\" valign=\"top\" width=\"638\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\">Interested Candidate Can Read the Full Notification Before Apply Online.</span><br>\n</b></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"9\" valign=\"top\" width=\"638\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\